/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/materion-corporation-mtrn-q1-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2019-07-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"Second quarter 2019 value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal cost, were $194.9 million, an all-time record, and up 3% versus the prior year second quarter, and up 4% sequentially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/materion-corporation-mtrn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"The increase includes commercial investments to drive our long-term strategy, partially offset by administrative cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/materion-corporation-mtrn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph Kelley","x":"The improvement in operating profit is due to sales growth, lower metal consignment fees, and savings from cost reduction actions, which more than offset unfavorable manufacturing yields.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/materion-corporation-mtrn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"China tariffs and company-specific selling bands were the primary contributors to the decline in value-added sales into the telecom and data center end market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jugal Vijayvargiya","x":"I mean clearly from a China perspective, as you know there is issues related to the tariff situation and the trade situation that are contributing to some direct and indirect negative impact to our semiconductor business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"The third quarter 2019 value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through metal costs were $188.6 million up 4% versus the prior year third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"The adjustments are made in both the current year and prior year periods for comparative purposes and remove non-recurring special items for asset impairments, pension curtailment, cost reduction initiatives and certain income tax adjustments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"The reduction in forecasted sales volume and restructuring actions triggered asset impairment testing in the quarter resulting in an $11.6 million non-cash goodwill impairment charge and a $2.6 million non-cash other asset impairment charge.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-02-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"Trade and tariff situation with China continue to be a drag on sales, particularly in the telecom and data center end market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/materion-corp-mtrn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-02-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"The telecom and data center markets continue to be impacted by the ongoing tariff and trade situation with China, while automotive connector demand remains soft in Europe and Asia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/materion-corp-mtrn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-02-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"Value-added sales, which excludes the impact of pass-through precious metal cost totaled $733.7 million for the full year of 2019, relatively flat compared to $739 million in 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/materion-corp-mtrn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"The 8% improvement in operating profit was led by cost reduction actions, partially offset by unfavorable product mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/materion-corp-mtrn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2019 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"The year-over-year decrease in operating profit was due to lower medical sales volumes, partially offset by cost savings generated from third quarter restructuring actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/materion-corp-mtrn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-04-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"The decrease in sales can be primarily attributed to lower demand across all markets as a result of COVID-19, continued tariff impacts and the timing of defense sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/materion-corp-mtrn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"First quarter 2020 value added sales which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal cost were $158.7 million, down 2% compared to the fourth quarter and down 15% versus the $187.7 million in the first quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/materion-corp-mtrn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"This will be a significant structural cost reduction to the PAC business where we are the only fully vertically integrated beryllium producer in the world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/materion-corp-mtrn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joseph P. Kelley","x":"During the quarter, we recorded restructuring expense of $2.2 million related to the planned closure of our Detroit and Fremont facilities primarily for employee severance and other facility closure obligations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/materion-corp-mtrn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-07-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen F. Shamrock","x":"Second quarter, value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through metal cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/materion-corp-mtrn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen F. Shamrock","x":"In the second quarter, we recorded restructuring expense of $2.4 million related to the previously announced closure of our Detroit and Fremont facilities primarily for relocation costs and severance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/materion-corp-mtrn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen F. Shamrock","x":"Excluding special items related to COVID-19, restructuring charges and the acquisition of Optics Balzers, adjusted EBIT was $13.9 million or 9% of value-added sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/materion-corp-mtrn-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcrip.aspx"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-10-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"Telecom and data center end market sales were also lower due to lower demand related to the continued impacts of tariffs and COVID-19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"Third quarter value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, we're $167.5 million, up 4% compared to second quarter value-added sales of $161 million, and down 11% versus the third quarter of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Stephen Shamrock","x":"In the third quarter, we recorded restructuring expense of $2.6 million related primarily to the previously announced closure of our Detroit and Fremont facilities for relocation cost and severance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MTRN 2020 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Shelly M. Chadwick","x":"In the fourth quarter, we recorded restructuring expense of $4.1 million related primarily to the previously announced closure of our Detroit and Fremont facilities and the closure of our large area coatings business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/materion-corp-mtrn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly M. Chadwick","x":"Value added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal cost reached a record $198.6 million, up 29% versus the first quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/materion-corp-mtrn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly M. Chadwick","x":"Value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, reached a record $207.9 million, up 31% from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/materion-corporation-mtrn-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"As a result of that, any time that we see situations that warrant a price adjustment, whether it be raw material price increases or any other adjustments, we want to make sure that we have a model that works for us and we discuss appropriately with our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/materion-corporation-mtrn-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"As a result, we are raising our full year guidance to $3.25 to $3.45.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/materion-corporation-mtrn-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Shelly M. Chadwick","x":"With the ongoing strength of our organic pipeline and good underlying demand across our end markets, we're increasing our outlook for the remainder of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/materion-corporation-mtrn-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"Our value-based pricing model, precious metal pass-through agreements and vertical integration continue to assist in mitigating the effects of inflationary pressures, and our teams are keenly focused on operational excellence and effective cost control.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/materion-corporation-mtrn-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly M. Chadwick","x":"Value-added sales, which excludes the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, reached an all-time high of $215.8 million, up 31% from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/materion-corporation-mtrn-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2021-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"Taking into account normal year-end seasonality, we expect Q4 earnings in the range of $0.95 to $1.05, raising our full year guidance once again to $3.73 to $3.83, an increase of 86% from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/materion-corporation-mtrn-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2022-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"Value added sales which exclude the impact of pass through precious metal costs for $237.4 million for the quarter, up 27% from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/17/materion-mtrn-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2021 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2022-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"The increase was primarily due to higher volumes, positive pricing, and favorable operating performance resulting in 220 basis points of margin expansion year-on-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/17/materion-mtrn-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2022 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"Value-added sales, which excludes the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, were $266.8 million for the quarter, up 34% from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/materion-mtrn-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2022 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2022-04-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"The increase was primarily due to higher volumes, positive pricing and mix, operational performance, and the impact of the HCS-Electronic Materials acquisition, partially offset by fuel cost inflation and the impact of the new facility start-up costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/materion-mtrn-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2022 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2022-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"With the excellent start in Q1, combined with our strong order book, progress on our organic initiatives, and the performance of HCS-Electronic Materials, we are increasing our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/28/materion-mtrn-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2022 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"Value-added sales, which excludes the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, were $277.2 million for the quarter, up 33% from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/materion-mtrn-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2022 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2022-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"David Silver","x":"So just maybe a thought on maintaining or reiterating the guidance over a period where the macro outlook has changed?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/03/materion-mtrn-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jugal Vijayvargiya","x":"When we released our first-quarter earnings in late April, there was considerable uncertainty surrounding the tariff environment, which we noted as a qualifier to our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/materion-mtrn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Phil Gibbs","x":"And then lastly for me, clearly, clearly outlined the tariff risks or potential tariffs tariff risks associated with China last quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/materion-mtrn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2025-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"In the second quarter, value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, were $269 million, down 2% organically from the prior year and up 4% sequentially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/materion-mtrn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"Electronic Materials will continue to benefit from the proliferation of AI and data center demand, driving sustained outgrowth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/materion-mtrn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"Reflecting on 2025, I am extremely proud of the significant progress we made while navigating some turbulent times particularly in the first half, with the uncertainty around tariffs, and the related impact to our China business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/materion-mtrn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"I think, you know, so we have highlighted this over the last year or so in particular that we saw a decrease in our sales in China just based on all the geopolitical issues, tariff issues, etcetera.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/materion-mtrn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly M. Chadwick","x":"In the fourth quarter, value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, were $253,900,000, up 7% organically from the prior year excluding Precision Clad Strip.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/materion-mtrn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly M. Chadwick","x":"The decrease was attributable to the Clad Strip volume decline, partially offset by higher volume, strong price/mix, and improved performance in Electronic Materials and Precision Optics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/materion-mtrn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2025 Q4","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jugal K. Vijayvargiya","x":"EBITDA was up an impressive 50% with 470 basis points of margin expansion, as the power of the work our team has done to streamline and strengthen that business is magnified by increasing volumes and a strong mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/materion-mtrn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jugal Vijayvargiya","x":"Our Performance Materials business plays a strategic role across the infrastructure powering AI F.rom advanced data centers to global connectivity networks and next-generation energy systems, our engineered alloys and beryllium-based materials enable performance, reliability and safety at scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/materion-mtrn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"In the first quarter, value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, were $261.8 million, up 10% from the prior year when excluding Precision Clad Strip.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/materion-mtrn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q1","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"We delivered 140 basis points of margin expansion, driven by higher volume, favorable price/mix and strong operational performance, particularly within Electronic Materials and Precision Optics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/materion-mtrn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jugal Vijayvargiya","x":"Finally, telecom & data center grew almost 50%, propelled by the AI infrastructure build-out and significant wireless network expansion outside the U.S. As we look to the back half of the year, we're excited about the broad-based strength we're seeing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/materion-mtrn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jugal Vijayvargiya","x":"Look at the supplies that we're making in the semiconductor side with memory applications, with high-bandwidth memory, high-performance logic, data storage, we know what's going on in the builds, whether it's data centers, whether it's for AI applications, it is for builds that are happening today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/materion-mtrn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-08-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jugal Vijayvargiya","x":"Across all our businesses, higher volumes, strong price/mix and outstanding operational execution came together to produce record earnings of $1.90 per share, up nearly 40% from a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/materion-mtrn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-08-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"In the second quarter, value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, were a record $308.2 million, up 15% from the prior year and up 18% sequentially.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/materion-mtrn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q2","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jugal Vijayvargiya","x":"…significant progress, I think, on the manufacturing, the productivity, the yields, of course, rightsizing the business to the appropriate sales levels and ensuring that we're delivering to our customers in a timely manner and therefore, delivering the right level of margin growth as you've…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/materion-mtrn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jugal Vijayvargiya","x":"Certainly the AI side, the data center side is important.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/materion-corp-mtrn-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MTRN 2026 Q3","e":"mtrn","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Shelly Chadwick","x":"In the third quarter, value-added sales, which exclude the impact of pass-through precious metal costs, 